    "title": "One dead in George County crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "darkhorsepressnow.com\nwebsite\nGeorge County, Mississippi\nOne dead in George County crash\nBy Therese Apel,\n1 days agoOne person is dead and three others were hospitalized after a fatal crash on Highway 612 in George County Sunday. A 2018 Nissan Rogue driven by 30-year-old Fernando Galvan, and passenger, 28-year-old Kayla Galvan, both of Semmes, AL, traveled east on Highway 612 when it collided with a 2008 Cadillac STS. The Cadillac was driven by 24-year-old Reanna Rockwell of Lucedale and passenger, Memori Maxwell, 44, of Chunchula, AL, who were traveling south on Walt Tanner Rd.",
